# The generator's own template, which shares this chart's templates/ directory.
#
# prow/jobs/generator.go writes templates/add-resource.tpl and reads it with text/template
# and its own data model ($.ImageContext, $.Config). Helm renders everything under
# templates/, so without this line Helm tries to evaluate it as a manifest and fails with
# `nil pointer evaluating interface {}.ImageRepo`. Verified both ways.
#
# Named exactly rather than as *.tpl on purpose: if the generator starts emitting another
# template here, the render breaks loudly and someone has to decide what it means, instead
# of the file being silently skipped.
templates/add-resource.tpl

# Not chart inputs. The agent source tree and its Dockerfile are built into the
# add-resource image; excluding them keeps the chart Argo CD loads small.
agents/
images/
